DATA='Capacitance definition|Q=C*V|Q,C,V|s+s|V across capacitor; signed plate charge.|P:1,-C*V;P:-V,Q;P:-C,Q\nParallel plate C|C=kd*eps0*A/d|C,kd,A,d|+++s|Full dielectric fill; d>0; neglect fringing.|P:d,-A*eps0*kd;P:-A*eps0,C*d;P:-eps0*kd,C*d;P:C,-A*eps0*kd\nCapacitor energy CV|U=C*V^2/2|U,C,V|s+s|Stored energy>=0.|P:2,-C*V^2;P:-V^2,2*U;P:-C,0,2*U\nCapacitor energy Q|U=Q^2/(2*C)|U,Q,C|ss+|Stored energy>=0.|P:2*C,-Q^2;P:-1,0,2*C*U;P:2*U,-Q^2\nCapacitor energy QV|U=Q*V/2|U,Q,V|sss|Consistent signs for Q and V.|P:2,-Q*V;P:-V,2*U;P:-Q,2*U\nCapacitors parallel 2|C=C1+C2|C,C1,C2|+++|Same potential difference.|P:1,-C1 - C2;P:-1,C - C2;P:-1,C - C1\nCapacitors series 2|1/C=1/C1+1/C2|C,C1,C2|+++|Same charge magnitude; ideal initially uncharged.|P:-C1 - C2,C1*C2;P:-C + C2,-C*C2;P:-C + C1,-C*C1\nElectric energy density|ue=kd*eps0*Ef^2/2|ue,kd,Ef|0+s|Linear dielectric; kd=1 in vacuum.|P:2,-Ef^2*eps0*kd;P:-Ef^2*eps0,2*ue;P:-eps0*kd,0,2*ue\nSpherical conductor C|C=4*pi*eps0*R|C,R|++|Isolated sphere; potential relative infinity.|P:1,-4*pi*R*eps0;P:-4*pi*eps0,C\nSpherical capacitor|C=4*pi*eps0*r*R/(R-r)|C,r,R|+++|Concentric vacuum shells; 0<r<R.|P:R - r,-4*pi*R*eps0*r;P:-C - 4*pi*R*eps0,C*R;P:C - 4*pi*eps0*r,-C*r\nCoaxial capacitor|C=2*pi*eps0*l/ln(R/r)|C,l,R,r|++++|Vacuum cylinders; 0<r<R; ignore ends.|P:ln(R/r),-2*pi*eps0*l;P:-2*pi*eps0,C*ln(R/r);E:r*exp(2*pi*eps0*l/C);E:R*exp(-2*pi*eps0*l/C)\nCapacitor charge sharing|V=(C1*V0+C2*Vb)/(C1+C2)|V,C1,V0,C2,Vb|s+s+s|Parallel after disconnecting batteries; charge conserved.|P:C1 + C2,-C1*V0 - C2*Vb;P:V - V0,C2*V - C2*Vb;P:-C1,C1*V + C2*V - C2*Vb;P:V - Vb,C1*V - C1*V0;P:-C2,C1*V - C1*V0 + C2*V\nSphere charge sharing|q=Q*r/(r+R)|q,Q,r,R|ss++|Far-separated conducting spheres joined by wire; Q total.|P:R + r,-Q*r;P:-r,R*q + q*r;P:-Q + q,R*q;P:q,-Q*r + q*r'
